            "plain_text": "Cybernetics is a systems discipline uniquely suited to wicked challenges because it forefronts information and purpose for guiding design and action in today’s complex entanglements of natural, technological, and social systems.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
